// The board's own gestures (gesture-art.mjs), each on a frozen clock part
// way through: BOOT handing over an idle agent, a stroke, a boop on the
// nose, a shake (dbg.imu standing in for the motion sensor), then face
// down (dim, every reaction refused) and turned back up (peekaboo); last a
// quick swipe, which plays the stroke's design and goes as a gesture.
